n pastel,"}, {"beat": 172, "text": "My visual memory, it\u2019s truly special."}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "So if you want to recall those precious times,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "Open your eyes and let life\u2019s colors shine."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "For my visual memory is here to share,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "With a touch of magic, forever there."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}